  "author": "Harsh",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "description": "The Real Estate 7 premium theme for WordPress is vulnerable to Reflected Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) attack vector in versions up to, and including, v3.3.4 via the \u0027ct_additional_features\u0027 option due to insufficient input sanitization and output escaping. This vulnerability allows unauthenticated attackers to inject malicious JavaScript payload in the search page that execute if they can trick a user into performing an action such as clicking on a link.\n",
